{
    "title": "HeroSearch: Aid for Heroscape",
    "description": "HeroSearch can be used to assist in the game play of the turn-based miniature board game HeroScape.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- 1550+ official & community created characters\r\n- Extensive search functionality for heroes\r\n- Wide array of searchable data for each character\r\n\r\n- Create and save armies\r\n- Armies can include max point, hex, and figure values\r\n\r\n- Random dice roll for D6 & D20 dice with history tracker\r\n- Character creator (locally saved on device)\r\n\r\nThis app is currently in production. Please send feedback or suggestions to developer's email.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nHeroSearch is an unofficial, free fan-made app and is NOT affiliated, endorsed, or supported by Hasbro or the heroscapers website in any way. Some images/logos/names used in this app are copyrighted and are supported under fair use. These images/logos/names are not endorsed by any of their owners, and they are used simply for aesthetic purposes. No copyright infringement is intended, and any request to remove one of the images/logos/names will be honored.",
    "descriptionHTML": "HeroSearch can be used to assist in the game play of the turn-based miniature board game HeroScape.<br><br>Features:<br>- 1550+ official &amp; community created characters<br>- Extensive search functionality for heroes<br>- Wide array of searchable data for each character<br><br>- Create and save armies<br>- Armies can include max point, hex, and figure values<br><br>- Random dice roll for D6 &amp; D20 dice with history tracker<br>- Character creator (locally saved on device)<br><br>This app is currently in production. Please send feedback or suggestions to developer&#39;s email.<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>HeroSearch is an unofficial, free fan-made app and is NOT affiliated, endorsed, or supported by Hasbro or the heroscapers website in any way. Some images/logos/names used in this app are copyrighted and are supported under fair use. These images/logos/names are not endorsed by any of their owners, and they are used simply for aesthetic purposes. No copyright infringement is intended, and any request to remove one of the images/logos/names will be honored.",
